Natural-BBQ: Third-Party Data Attribution
==========================================

This repository contains code and derived data for the Natural-BBQ project.

BBQ (Bias Benchmark for Question Answering)
--------------------------------------------
Natural-BBQ contains transformations derived from BBQ, which is distributed
under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Original BBQ data files in dataset/bbq/data/ are redistributed under CC BY 4.0.

  Parrish, A., Chen, A., Nangia, N., Padmakumar, V., Phang, J., Thompson, J.,
  Htut, P. M., & Bowman, S. R. (2022). BBQ: A hand-built bias benchmark for
  question answering. In Findings of ACL 2022.
  https://github.com/nyu-mll/BBQ

WildChat-4.8M
--------------
WildChat-4.8M, distributed under ODC-By (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/),
was used to derive the target style distribution. Raw WildChat prompts, prompt
identifiers, and user metadata are not redistributed in this repository.

  Zhao, W. X., et al. (2024). WildChat: 1M ChatGPT Interaction Logs in the Wild.
  In ICLR 2024.
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/WildChat-4.8M

